{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"sadac5a30345c5c1d","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-bcc9fe357d71ea779b1c","text":"今日の戦果は？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-08efc2360d3f8d14a692","text":"（写真を見せる）","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ce50b15e0ed2f281d610","text":"お疲れ様！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5268ad34462a00484e23","text":"でも…ウチが撮ったのとは違うような…？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-18215e7d05728bfba72d","text":"違いはないはず","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cf6d2599a759bb1ab918","text":"同じに見えるけど","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6e0434fb8136f598bbc2","text":"う～ん、ウチがよく覚えてないだけかも…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-bae2eac70cfd7d9132c8","text":"でも2匹のプーマンなんて変なもの、絶対に撮ってないと思うんだけどな…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-b801c784ac6af7500c13","text":"時が経てば、景色は変わらなくても人は…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e1e21a6f9330e2320a19","text":"時が経てば、景色は変わらなくても人は…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-886965c69a42a2a64a2d","text":"なに感傷的なこと言ってんの！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ffa0c299871544b05cff","text":"そうそう、ウチのとこの収集がもうすぐ終わるんだ","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4632928c0ebc2f49b4ac","text":"残った2枚の写真はアンタに任せたからね！","speaker":""}]}
